  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the HTML UI, when navigating to a binary resource that links to external content, the view should redirect to the description of the binary resource, not the binary itself.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For example:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "> curl -i -X PUT -H\"Content-Type: message/external-body; access-type=URL; URL=\\\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://animal-dream.com/data_images/cow/cow8.jpg"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://animal-dream.com/data_images/cow/cow8.jpg\\",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"\" \"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/external"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/external",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the HTML UI, navigate to the root of the repository, then click on the \"external\" link... the user should be redirected to the description instead of the external resource.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For comparison, create a managed binary resource and navigate to it in the HTML UI:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "> curl -i -X PUT -H\"Content-Type: image/png\" --data-binary @image.png \"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/internal"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/internal",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
